592	\section{Typed conditionally linear distributions}
593	% Paper section label sec:types kept for cross-reference fidelity. Only the mathematical
594	% typed material (typed CL functions and distributions, graph distributions) is stated
595	% here; the typed sampler and verifier machinery of the source is outside the scope of
